flowchart LR
 SRC["Repository baseline and worktree contents"] --> SNAP["Immutable content manifest<br/>base / head / local digest"]
 SNAP --> TREE["Tree-sitter structural extraction"]
 SNAP --> SEM["Optional .NET / TS / Swift / Rust pack"]
 TREE --> VALID["Validate symbols, references<br/>coverage and source identity"]
 SEM --> VALID
 VALID --> GEN["Staging graph generation"]
 GEN --> PUB["Publish manifest after complete validation"]
 PUB --> VIEW["GraphView<br/>baseline + changed paths + tombstones"]
 VIEW --> QUERY["Search / source / traversal / impact / retrieval"]
 MISSING["Missing, failed or stale requested view"] --> UNAVAILABLE["Explicit scoped unavailable or stale result"]
 BASE["Other worktree or main"] -. "Never a silent substitute" .-> UNAVAILABLE
